WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:08.750
After two weeks of wear a pair of jeans will
have grown a 1,000-strong colony of bacteria

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:24.740
on the front, 1,500–2,500 on the back and
10,000 on the crotch.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:31.170
The whole country of Liechtenstein can be
rented for $70,000 a night, for a minimum

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.689
of two nights.

00:00:32.689 --> 00:00:34.700
It sleeps 900.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:41.149
More Falklands veterans have committed suicide
since the war than were killed during it.

00:00:41.149 --> 00:00:44.979
The Queen of England is related to Vlad the
Impaler.

00:00:44.979 --> 00:00:50.430
Aerosmith have made more money from Guitar
Hero than from any of their albums.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:56.109
Arabic words are written right to left, but
Arabic numbers left to right.

00:00:56.109 --> 00:01:01.609
Arabic speakers reading anything with a lot
of numbers in have to read in both directions

00:01:01.609 --> 00:01:02.750
at once.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:08.680
A single bolt of lightning contains enough
energy to cook 100,000 pieces of toast.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:14.680
A greetings card that can play 'Happy Birthday'
has more computing power than existed in the

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:16.830
whole world in 1950.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:23.830
In 2010, Ghana banned the sale of second-hand
underpants.

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:29.770
The King James Bible has inspired the lyrics
of more pop songs than any other book.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:36.240
Harry Houdini could pick up pins with his
eyelashes and thread a needle with his toes.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:41.950
70% of all animals in the jungle rely on figs
for their survival.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:47.420
In 2010, the Catholic Church had an income
of $97 billion.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:54.350
Mussolini tortured his enemies by forcing
them to swallow massive doses of castor oil.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:02:05.820
In the US between 1983 and 2000, there were
568 plane crashes. 51,207 of the 53,487 people

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:11.230
aboard got out alive: a survival rate of 96%.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:16.180
If you drilled a tunnel straight through the
Earth and jumped in, it would take you exactly

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:31.959
42 minutes and 12 seconds to get to the other
side.

